WEBVTT

00:00:26.705 --> 00:00:30.409
yashiringanmi yoki bu nasl qoldirishimiz
uchun tabiat o'ylab topgan nayrangmi?

00:00:30.409 --> 00:00:32.337
Bizga faqat shu kerakmi?

00:00:32.337 --> 00:00:34.558
Umuman uning keragi bormikin?

00:00:34.558 --> 00:00:36.365
Agar muhabbatdan biror maqsad bo'lsa,

00:00:36.365 --> 00:00:39.965
na biror olim, na biror psixolog 
buni kashf eta olgan emas.

00:00:39.965 --> 00:00:41.453
Ammo uzoq tarixiy davr
mobaynida

00:00:41.453 --> 00:00:46.866
ayrim taniqli faylasuflarimiz ba'zi 
qiziqarli nazariyalarni ilgari surdi.

00:00:46.866 --> 00:00:49.728
Sevgi bizni qayta bir butun qiladi.

00:00:49.728 --> 00:00:51.523
Qadimgi yunon faylasufi Aflotunning

00:00:51.523 --> 00:00:55.654
fikricha, biz bir butun bo'lish 
uchun sevamiz.

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:58.298
Uning "Bazm" asarida tasvirlanishicha,

00:00:58.298 --> 00:01:01.050
kechki ziyofat chog'ida 
komediyanavis Aristofan